From: Olav Kjell Holtan <chairman@steni.example> (Steni AS)
To: m.barton@cep-holdings.example
Date: 2005-03-10
Subject: Termination of the Exclusive Distributor Agreement

"Reference is made to the [EDA] between Steni AS and CEP Holdings Ltd, our written notice of 21 December 2004 in which we awarded you 30 days to rectify certain contractual breaches, the subsequent correspondence between ourselves, and our meeting of 7 March 2005 in Oslo. As none of the breaches specified in our letter of 21 December 2004 have been rectified within the 30 days deadline, Steni AS hereby terminates the [EDA] with immediate effect pursuant to Clause 7.2 of the Agreement."

Olav Kjell Holtan
Chairman, Steni AS

--
RECONSTRUCTED FROM THE PUBLISHED JUDGMENT. Not an original document.
Source: CEP Holdings v Steni [2009] EWHC 2447 (QB), paras 10-11, 49.
Text quoted in the judgment. CEP Holdings, through solicitors Hill Dickinson, treated this as repudiatory by letter of 7 April 2005. Addresses are placeholders.
